      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a bowel obstruction needing urgent surgical care is my leading thought, not anything worse. I want urgent blood tests done, that's for vomiting. An abdominal X-ray is what I'd like next, for possible obstruction. Nothing to eat or drink, and you are going to hospital now. Let's review you straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
